  "body": "Discover East Coast Heights – Affordable, Stylish, and Convenient Living\r\n\r\nThis brand-new home in the exciting East Coast Heights development offers unbeatable value with style, comfort, and convenience all wrapped in one.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n\r\n• 3 generous bedrooms & 1.5 stylish bathrooms\r\n\r\n• Freehold title – No Body Corp!\r\n\r\n• Section: approx. 108m² | Floor area: approx. 110m²\r\n\r\n• 1 exclusive car park\r\n\r\n• Private garden – Pet friendly!\r\n\r\n• CCC and Title issued – ready to go!\r\n\r\n\r\nContemporary Living Includes:\r\n\r\n• Modern kitchen with premium appliances\r\n\r\n• Air conditioning units & double-glazed windows\r\n\r\n• Digital door lock for added security\r\n\r\n• Sun-filled open plan living with a smart layout\r\n\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights:\r\n\r\n• Minutes to SH1, Hibiscus Coast Bus Station & Silverdale Shopping Centre\r\n\r\n• Close to NZ’s only Indoor Snow Park, Silverdale Adventure Park & Gulf Harbour Golf\r\n\r\n• Enjoy local beaches, surfing spots & walking tracks\r\n\r\n• Near top-rated schools, new medical centre, daycare & future business hub\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first home buyer, investor or downsizer – this is the perfect opportunity!\r\n\r\nCall now for more information or visit us at the open homes!",
